  "notes" : [
    {
      "framed" : true,
      "id" : "F4335406-EF05-41BE-B518-23DA937BC33F",
      "size" : 12,
      "text" : "VFD test pattern\n\nG1 32.768 kHz / 4096 (U1) = 8 Hz clocks the HV5812 (U3).\nIts data output goes back to its data input through an\ninverter (U2), so the 20 stages fill with ones and then\nwith zeros: the IV-18's segments light one by one, then\nits digits (grids) from the right, and then go out again.\n\nP1: 1 = +5 V, 2 = +24 V (anodes and grids), 3 = GND.\nThe filament runs from 5 V (85 mA).",
      "x" : 420,
      "y" : -260
    }
  ],
